      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaasuri bagotianera abanto ba Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 18:13-37; 19:14-19,35-37; Isaya 36:1-22; 37:8-38)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’amang’ana ayio ay’obwegenwa gakorirwe, Senakeribu, omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, agasoa ase ense y’Abayuda. Akanaaria emechie yagiteire chindwaki, akarengereria kobua emechie eyio ng’a ayebwate ebe eyaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Hezekia aroche ng’a Senakeribu ochire oganetie korwania Yerusalemu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agasemania nabanene b’oborwoti bwaye, na abanto baye chituoni batiche chintuboka na batange amaache korwa ase chinsoko chiarenge isiko y’omochie, nabarabwo bakamokonya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abange bagasangererekana, bagatanga amaache e chinsoko chionsi na ay’akarooche karenge ase orogongo roria rwonsi, bagateeba, “Nase ki abarwoti b’Abaasuri barache banyore amaache ekero bagocha aiga?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti agachaaka gokora emeremo nomokia omonene, akaroisia orwaki ase konya rwatagokire, na akaagacha emerobiri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "igoro yaye. Boigo akaagacha orwaki ronde isiko y’orwo, na agakong’ia Milo, egekengero keria kiarenge ase Omochie o Daudi. Naende akaroisia ebirwanero ebinge, akagooncha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ne chinguba chinyinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabeka abatang’ani b’abasikari igoro ase abanto, akabasangereria amo agwo ase eraaro ase egeita ki’omochie, agakwana nabarabwo, akabaremia, ogoteeba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mobe abakong’u na abaremu! Timwoboa gose timoondoka ase obosio bw’omorwoti bw’Abaasuri na emeganda eyio ere amo nere. Oyore amo naintwe nigo are omonene komobua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti oria nigo are ne chinguru chia Mwanyabaanto, korende Omonene, Nyasae oito, nigo are amo naintwe ase ogotokonya na gotorwanisia.” Abanto bakaba abaremu ase engencho y’amang’ana a Hezekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio, Senakeribu, omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, oria onaaretie Lakisi amo nabarwani baye bonsi b’esegi, agatoma abasomba baye Yerusalemu ase Hezekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, na ase Abayuda bonsi abwo barenge Yerusalemu, agateeba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya naro inche Senakeribu, omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, ngokwana: Ninki mosemeretie, inwe abamonaaririe agwo Yerusalemu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Hezekia tari kobasiria na kobatiga mokwe motari nendagera na ebinyugwa ekero akobateebia: Omonene, Nyasae oito, natotoorie korwa ase okoboko kw’omorwoti bw’Abaasuri?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Hezekia oyo tari ere oria osaririe aase aimokererete igoro agwo ase Omonene agosasimerwa, amo nebisasimero biaye? Naende ere agachiika Abayuda na abanto ba Yerusalemu, ogoteeba: Bosio bw’egesasiimero ekemo nao morasasimere, na igoro ase kerokio mobe mokorua ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe timomanyeti aya inche ne chisokoro chiane twakorerete abanto bonsi b’echinse chinde? Inee! Chinyasae chi’ebisaku biria nchianyarete gokonya chinse chiria na gochirusia ase okoboko kwane?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nereri ase chinyasae chionsi chi’ebisaku biria chisokoro chiane chiasiretie kegima yanyarete gokonya abanto baye korwa ase okoboko kwane?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, timobaisa gwancha Hezekia abang’aine, gose abasirie ase enchera eyio, na timobaisa komwegena, ekiagera enyasae ende y’egesaku kende gionsi, gose ey’oborwoti bonde, tiyana konyara gotooria abanto baye korwa ase okoboko kwane, gose korwa ase amaboko e chisokoro chiane. Nyasae oino nigo are bosa goetania chinyasae chiria; takonyara kobatooria korwa ase okoboko kwane!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na abasomba ba Senakeribu bakamenta korama Omonene Nyasae na Hezekia, omosomba oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Senakeribu akarika riruube ri’ogochecheri’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agakwana amang’ana amabe igoro asare, agateeba, “Buna koreng’ana chinyasae chi’ebisaku bie chinse chiasinyirwe gotooria abanto babo korwa ase okoboko kwane, naboigo na Nyasae bwa Hezekia takonyara gotooria abanto baye korwa ase okoboko kwane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaasuri bagaaka eriogi rinene ase omonwa bw’Ekeyuda ase abanto ba Yerusalemu abarenge igoro ase orwaki ase okobagosa na koboboyia, erinde baire omochie oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagakwana igoro ya Nyasae o Yerusalemu, buna bakwanete igoro ye chinyasae chi’abaanto b’ebisaku b’ense eye, chiria chiaroisetigwe namaboko a Mwanyabaanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Hezekia omorwoti na Isaya omobani, mosinto bw’Amosi, bagasaba ase engencho y’amang’ana ayio na bakarera ase Nyasae o igoro ng’a abakoonye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene agatoma omomalaika oye agaita abasikari bonsi b’omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, baria barenge chituoni, na abatang’ani amo nabanene bonsi ase egetwori kiabo. Omorwoti oria akairana gochia ase ense yaye ore nobosooku obonene, na ekero asoete ase enyomba y’enyasae yaye, abamura baye bande bakamoaka, bakamoita nemioro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo Omonene akorete agatooria Hezekia na abanto ba Yerusalemu korwa ase okoboko gwa Senakeribu, omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, na korwa ase amaboko ’ababisa babo bonsi. Erio akabaa obotoereru ase chinsemo chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abange bakarentera Omonene ebiegwa agwo Yerusalemu, bakarentera na Hezekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, ebinto bi’erigori rinene. Korwa ase engaki eria na kogenderera Hezekia akaba okoegwa amasikani amanene nabaanto b’ebisaku bionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oborwaire bwa Hezekia na oboenenu bwaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 20:1-3,12-19; Isaya 38:1-3; 39:1-8)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase amatuko aria Hezekia akarwara, akaba ang’e nogokwa. Agasaba Omonene, na ere akamoiraneria ase okomworokia ekemanyererio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekiagera Hezekia arenge omonto omoenenu ase enkoro yaye tairaneretie ng’a mbuya mono ase amaya akoreretwe, Ase engencho eyio endamwanu y’Omonene egacha igoro asare, na ase Abayuda, na ase abanto ba Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia agekeyia, ageitia ase engencho y’oboenenu bw’enkoro yaye, na abanto ba Yerusalemu nabarabwo bagekeyia. Ase ayio endamwamu y’Omonene tiyacha igoro ase bare ase amatuko a Hezekia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obotenenku bwa Hezekia na obonene bwaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia nigo abwate obotenenku obonge, na abanto abange nigo bamosigete. Akeagachera ebigachero ase arenge kobeeka chifeta, ne chitaabu, na amagena e rigori rinene, na ebinsari, ne chinguba, na ebinto ao ao bi’erigori rinene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo akeagachera ebiage bie chindagera chiagesetwe, na ebigachero bi’edivai na ebi’amaguta ’amazeituni, na ameeri e chitugo ao ao, amo naye ching’ondi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akenyorera emechie emenge, na amaicho amange, ekiagera Nyasae konya omoeire obotenenku obonge mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia oyo, nere oria otichete chintuboka chia rogoro chi’amaache a Gihoni, erio akayagoberia gochia ase ensemo ya bosongo y’Omochie o Daudi. Akanyora ogosesenigwa ase emeremo yaye yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya nekero abanto batometwe nabanene ba Babiloni baborie komanya igoro y’egekone giakorekanete ase ense eria, Nyasae akaramotiga ake amoteeme amanye onsi ayarenge ime ase enkoro yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoerio bw’okogamba gwa Hezekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 20:20-21)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi Hezekia akorete, na ogokora kwaye okuya, nigo ariikire ase Okorora gwa Isaya omobani, mosinto bw’Amosi, ime ase Egetabu ki’Abarwoti b’Abayuda na ab’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia akarara ase chisokoro chiaye chiaraarete, agatindekwa ase egetirimboko ase chimbeera chi’ororeria rwa Daudi chiarenge. Abayuda bonsi na abanto ba Yerusalemu bakaorokia amasikani ase ogokwa kwaye. Na Manase, omomura oye, akaba okogamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
